A. Commit message:
fs/ntfs3: Backport marking inode as bad in mi_enum_attr

B. Change summary:
Backported the modification to `mi_enum_attr` that marks an inode as bad when an error is detected. This change introduces a new parameter `struct ntfs_inode *ni` into `mi_enum_attr`, and modifies all return points on error to jump to a new label `out`, where `_ntfs_bad_inode(&ni->vfs_inode)` is called before returning NULL. Similarly, `mi_find_attr` was updated to pass `ni` to `mi_enum_attr`.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Medium

